reference[55]: "  [--context NAME] [--file PATH (required for compose)] [--stale 15m]","  [--protect-live-owner] [--key K] [--idle D] [--max-lifetime D] [--full] [--axi | --json]","dibs adopt shell <pid> --owner KIND:ID --ttl D [--key K] [--idle D] [--max-lifetime D]","dibs adopt <kind|k3d|compose> <handle> --pending ID [--file PATH] [--axi | --json]",Explicitly lease an existing resource. Existence must be verified and no lease,may already own it. Captures cleanup configuration; does not recreate resources.,"Owner and positive TTL are required; with lease policies on, the policy",supplies the TTL. Release/sweep keep their preview defaults.,"shell (DIBS_SHELL_ADAPTER=1 or \"shell_adapter\": true) leases a running shell by","PID and start time, with its descendants such as gitstatusd. Cleanup refuses a","shell with a foreground job, sends SIGHUP, then SIGTERM and SIGKILL after 5s","each, reports each step on stderr, and verifies every member gone.","--key K: retries match owner, protection, adapter, mode, resource, Docker scope, and Compose file; TTL, description, and labels are ignored.","--protect-live-owner: only proven owner death reclaims; expiry alone never does.","Requires DIBS_LIVE_OWNER_PROTECTION=1 or \"live_owner_protection\": true.","--pending ID registers a resource the caller created for a pending lease (see","dibs create --pending); owner, TTL and context come from that lease. A retry","returns status already_done. Statuses: adopted, bound, already_done.","Examples:","  dibs adopt kind my-lab --owner pid:1234 --ttl 1h","  dibs adopt compose my-stack --file compose.yaml --owner pid:1234 --ttl 2h","  dibs adopt kind lab-7 --pending <id>","  dibs adopt shell \"$$\" --owner 'exec:test -e /tmp/task-7.open' --ttl 8h","","Lease policies are off until DIBS_LEASE_POLICIES=1 or \"lease_policies\": true.","While on, the policies table in the user config picks each new lease's rule by","resource kind, or kind/owner kind: binding time (TTL), owner (only owner death","ends it), or hybrid (owner-bound plus idle or max_lifetime); ttl, renew,","max_lifetime, grace and action destroy|report. The lease records its policy.","--ttl must fit max_lifetime; --idle D and --max-lifetime D may only tighten the","row. Off, --idle and --max-lifetime exit 2 naming the setting.","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Consumer contract 1 is off until DIBS_CONSUMER_CONTRACT=1 or \"consumer_contract\":","true in the user config. While off, reconcile, reclaim, explain, --pending and","--key exit 2 naming the setting, and extend and release behave as described above.","While on, these commands and extend and release follow contract 1:","exit 0 success with status; 1 operation failed, records retained; 2 usage;","3 refusal, nothing changed, with a stable reason: not_found, wrong_machine,","not_pending, already_leased, key_conflict, handle_exists, handle_mismatch,","resource_absent, resource_unknown, ambiguous, owner_alive, owner_unknown,","expired, owner_dead, job_deadline, max_lifetime, grace, resource_busy.",Extend success is renewed or reattached.,"Exit 1 is only for operation failures. Output carries contract: 1.",See docs/consumer-contract.md.,"","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;",75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child,was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait,failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.,76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).,Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure.
usage: "dibs adopt <kind|k3d|compose> <name> --owner KIND:ID --ttl D"
